## Why This Is Asked

This question probes end-to-end data flow, tenant isolation, governance, and resilience in a realistic Azure stack. It tests ability to choose Delta Lake on ADLS Gen2, per-tenant partitioning, streaming masking, RBAC/RLS, Purview governance, and DR planning, plus testing.

## Key Concepts

- Event streaming, Delta Lake partitioning, per-tenant masking
- Row-Level Security, RBAC, Purview governance
