## Why This Is Asked

Tests DR planning for a real-world, multi-region analytics platform with strict tenancy and governance.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-region DR topology and RPO/RTO targets
- ADLS Gen2 cross-region replication (GRS/RA-GRS)
- Unity Catalog metastore synchronization and RBAC
- Synapse Serverless multi-region routing
- Cost implications of cross-region data movement and failover testing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-logic for routing dashboards to primary vs secondary region
async function routeToRegion(userRequest) {
  if (primaryRegionAvailable()) {
    return fetchFromRegion(userRequest, 'eastus');
  } else {
    return fetchFromRegion(userRequest, 'westus');
  }
}
```

